# Unreal Engine 生成文件
**/Binaries/
**/DerivedDataCache/
**/Intermediate/
**/Saved/
**/Build/

# Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code 本地文件
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
*.sln
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs
*.opensdf
*.sdf
